The following judgments have been rendered by the Hon'ble Apex Court, where this point has been discussed:-
i) Union of India v. Arvind Shergill reported as (2000) 7 SCC 601;
ii) Pebam Ningol Mikoi Devi v. State of Manipura  reported as (2010) 9 SCC; and Bahar Nabi Mir vs Union Territory Of J&K & Ors on 16 December, 2025
